# Raw PDF source collection (large scans/books, CC-BY-NC-4.0 / non-redistributable,
# not meant to live on GitHub). Kept locally; see data/manifest.csv for the catalog.
/PDFs/

# Common Voice audio clips (large, CC0 but terms prohibit re-hosting/speaker ID).
# Publicly available directly from Mozilla Common Voice / Data Collective.
# Metadata (train/dev/validated .tsv etc.) stays tracked - only the audio itself
# is excluded. Path reflects the "existing datasets/" reorganization.
existing datasets/cv-corpus-*/**/clips/

